<v Booker>A new word? Let's be brave readers!

3
00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:15.370
<v Booker>First, look at the picture for a clue.

4
00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:19.580
<v Booker>Say the first sound... kuh, kuh, kuh.

5
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.480
<v Booker>Slide your finger, slow as honey.

6
00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:26.030
<v Booker>Kite!

7
00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:30.430
<v Booker>Not quite? That's okay.

8
00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:34.080
<v Booker>Big breath. Brave heart. I can try again!

end
00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:38.880
[End card] Brave reading, friends! Learn. Move. Explore. Belong. A Futures Friends play-along video.
